<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Report: July 19 - July 26, 2026</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@500;700;900&family=Share+Tech+Mono&display=swap');

        :root {
            --bg-pitch-black: #000000;
            --neon-orange: #ff5e00;
            --neon-orange-dim: #993800;
            --text-light: #f0f0f0;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            background-color: var(--bg-pitch-black);
            font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
            color: var(--text-light);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Abstract Neon Background Elements */
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;
            background: 
                repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 2px, rgba(255, 94, 0, 0.03) 2px, rgba(255, 94, 0, 0.03) 4px);
            z-index: -2;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .header-nav {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--neon-orange-dim);
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .btn-back {
            padding: 10px 25px;
            background: #000;
            color: var(--neon-orange);
            border: 2px solid var(--neon-orange);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            transition: 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 94, 0, 0.2);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .btn-back:hover {
            background: var(--neon-orange);
            color: #000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 94, 0, 0.6);
        }

        .status-indicator {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif; 
            color: var(--neon-orange);
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neon-orange);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        
        .status-dot {
            width: 10px; height: 10px;
            background: var(--neon-orange);
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-orange);
            animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.4; }
            100% { opacity: 1; }
        }

        .content-panel {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.9);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--neon-orange);
            padding: 40px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            position: relative;
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #fff;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .data-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .data-item {
            background: #050505;
            padding: 25px;
            border: 1px solid #222;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            position: relative;
        }

        .data-item:hover {
            border-color: var(--neon-orange-dim);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 94, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .data-label {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            color: var(--neon-orange);
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="header-nav">
        <a href="index.html" class="btn-back">◄ INITIALIZE HUB</a>
        <div class="status-indicator">
            <div class="status-dot"></div>
            SYS.ONLINE
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-panel">
        <h1>REPORT: JULY 19 - JULY 26</h1>
        
        <ul class="data-list">
            <li class="data-item">
                <span class="data-label">>>> TICKETS RESOLVED</span>
                Successfully closed 42 pending reports from the main queue during this timeframe.
            </li>
            <li class="data-item">
                <span class="data-label">>>> SYSTEM STATUS</span>
                All servers operating at 99.9% uptime throughout the week. Core temperature nominal.
            </li>
            <li class="data-item">
                <span class="data-label">>>> NOTES</span>
                Data collection finalized for the week of July 19th. No critical errors detected in the mainframe.
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
